1
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:10,800
If something gets in your way: flatten it.

2
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:15,600
The Phoenician Scheme is a comedy, adventure,
crime film directed by Wes Anderson.

3
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:20,400
Wealthy businessman Zsa-zsa Korda appoints his only
daughter, a nun, as sole heir to his estate.

4
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:25,200
As Korda embarks on a new enterprise, they soon become the target of
scheming tycoons, foreign terrorists, and determined assassins.

5
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Zsa-zsa Korda, played by Benicio del Toro.

6
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:34,800
Sister Liesl, played by Mia Threapleton.

7
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:39,600
Bjorn Lund, played by Michael Cera.

8
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:44,400
Prince Farouk, played by Riz Ahmed.

9
00:36:43,200 --> 00:36:49,200
Leland, played by Tom Hanks.

10
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:54,000
Reagan, played by Bryan Cranston.

11
00:44:52,800 --> 00:44:58,800
The Phoenician Scheme is a 2025 espionage black comedy thriller film produced, written
and directed by Wes Anderson from a story he conceived with Roman Coppola.

12
00:48:57,600 --> 00:49:03,600
The film features an ensemble cast that includes Benicio del Toro, Mia Threapleton, Michael Cera, Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston,
Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis, F.

13
00:53:02,400 --> 00:53:08,400
Murray Abraham, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Willem Dafoe, and Bill Murray.

14
00:57:07,200 --> 00:57:13,200
It tells the story of a ruthless businessman (del Toro) as he seeks to reconcile with his estranged
daughter (Threapleton) and complete an ambitious infrastructure project in Phoenicia.

15
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:18,000
The film was produced internationally between the United States and Germany by Anderson's
company American Empirical Pictures and Steven Rales's company Indian Paintbrush.

16
01:05:16,800 --> 01:05:22,800
Anderson talked about the film in June 2023 while promoting Asteroid City; he
said it had already been written before the 2023 WGA strike began.

17
01:09:21,600 --> 01:09:27,600
That September, he revealed that del Toro and Cera were planned to join the cast, and
he hoped to begin filming soon after the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike ended.

18
01:13:26,400 --> 01:13:32,400
The rest of the cast signed on between January and June 2024.

19
01:17:31,199 --> 01:17:37,199
Filming took place at Babelsberg Studio in Germany, between March
and June 2024, with cinematographer Bruno Delbonnel.

20
01:21:36,000 --> 01:21:42,000
Frequent Anderson collaborator Alexandre Desplat returned to compose the score.

21
01:25:40,800 --> 01:25:46,800
The Phoenician Scheme had its world premiere in the main competition of the Cannes Film Festival on May 18, 2025, and was released
theatrically in Germany by Universal Pictures on May 29, 2025, and in the United States by Focus Features on May 30, 2025.

22
01:29:45,600 --> 01:29:51,600
The film received generally positive reviews.

23
01:33:50,400 --> 01:33:56,400
The film explores themes of assassin, nun, espionage, family, plane crash.

24
01:37:55,200 --> 01:38:01,200
The tone is lighthearted.
